\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Remark}
\title{A historical event is not an update attempt}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{rollout}

\p{We formulate the record as immutable so that replay cannot rewrite its own
provenance. The sample-reuse setup in
\citet{Section 3}{miao2026when} retains behavior-policy rollouts while
recomputing current-policy ratios. Dynamic Gradient Gating (DGG), defined in
\citet{Section 5 and Algorithm 1}{miao2026when}, is one such reuse protocol,
but the complete tuple above is a note-level interface.}

\p{This distinction will let later theorems condition on recorded facts and
bound errors in attempt-local estimates separately.}
